senses.gloss:
अव-क्षिप्त (प्तः-प्ता-प्तं)
p. Ill thrown;
insinuated, said sarcastically.

अव-च्छेद (दः) 1.
m. Excision; a part;
peculiar property of any thing.

अवटु (टु) 2.
f. The back of the neck;
a hole; a well; a tree.

अव-तंस (सः-सं) 1.
m. n. Ear-ring;
crest, ornament.

अव-तरण (णं) 1.
n. Descending;
crossing; translating; quoting.

अव-तारण (णं) 1.
n. Being haunted;
end of a garment; worship.

अव-तीर्ण (णः-णा-णं)
p. Descended;
crossed, passed over; incarnate.

अवन्ति (न्ति) 2.
m. A city (Oujein);
name of a river.

अवयव (बः) 1.
m. A limb or member;
a part or portion; a syllogism.

अव-रोपण (णं) 1.
n. Diminishing;
descending; setting (as the sun.)

अव-लेह्य (ह्यः-ह्या-ह्यं)
a. To be licked;
thick or viscid.

अव-वाद (दः) 1.
m. A command;
censure; trust, confidence.

अव-ष्टम्भ (म्भः) 1.
m. Gold; a post;
a support; a beginning.

अव-स्कन्द (न्दः) 1.
m. A camp; assault;
descending; bathing.

अव-स्करक (कः) 1.
m. A sweeper;
a broom, a brush.

अव-हरण (णं) 1.
n. Taking away;
fining; plundering.

अव-हार (रः) 1.
m. A shark; a thief;
a water-elephant; a truce;
apostacy.

आ-वाधा (धा) 1.
f. Pain, distress;
segment of the base of a triangle.
